# Workshop data too large or too raw to belong in git. The scripts beside them rebuild every one.
# Mycelial Reverb: the engine's arrays and the compiled harnesses; the wav (the m4a is tracked).
pieces/*/out/*.f32
pieces/*/out/rooms
pieces/*/out/survey
pieces/*/out/probe
pieces/*/*.wav
# Stable Audio Open: raw generator takes.
pieces/*/*.npy
# The round's single page of embedded media, when it is built.
all pieces.html
# Copies of a project's own tracked files, used as inputs; their hashes are in provenance.json.
pieces/*/project/
